  "compositionRationale": [
    "[Design Philosophy]: This design organism is a sleek, modern, and professional technology infrastructure platform that values clarity, simplicity, and accessibility. The combination of a flat topology, airtight rhythm density, and a geometric display font like Asta Sans creates a sense of precision and attention to detail. The use of a warm, dark mode color scheme with a neutral temperature and organic edge style adds a touch of sophistication and approachability. The overall creative philosophy emerging from this chromosome combination is one of refined, high-tech minimalism.",
    "Layout: Documentation Layout (mobbin)",
    "Navigation: Persistent Sidebar Nav (hyperui)",
    "Hero: Carousel Hero (navnav)",
    "Section 1: Team Members Section (tailwind_ui)",
    "Section 2: Gallery/Media Grid Section (lapa_ninja)",
    "Section 3: Newsletter Signup Section (preline)",
    "Section 4: Process/Steps Section (magic_ui)",
    "Section 5: Comparison Table Section (relume)",
    "Section 6: Feature Grid Section (one_page_love)",
    "Section 7: Testimonial Cards Section (preline)",
    "Section 8: Pricing Table Section (magic_ui)",
    "Footer: Multi-Column Footer (navnav)",
    "Sidebar: Collapsible Right Sidebar (mobbin)",
    "CTA: Split CTA (land_book)",
    "[Must implement]: Use a flat, 7-section topology to create a sense of breadth and simplicity | Employ airtight rhythm density to maintain a consistent and precise visual flow | Utilize the geometric, tight-tracking characteristics of Asta Sans to create a sense of modernity and sophistication | Balance the narrow line length of Noto Sans Soyombo with the 1.25 type scale ratio to create a clear visual hierarchy | Apply the warm, dark mode color scheme (HSL(348°, 66%, 42%)) with 74% lightness to create a sense of depth and contrast | Incorporate organic edge styles to add a touch of approachability and humanity | Ensure all interactive elements have a matte physics material with roughness of 0.13 and metalness of 0.10",
    "[Must avoid]: Avoid using overly complex or ornate typography, as it would contradict the geometric, modern aesthetic of Asta Sans | Refrain from using bright, bold colors, as they would clash with the warm, dark mode color scheme | Do not use overly dramatic or attention-seeking motion effects, as they would disrupt the airtight rhythm density and refined atmosphere | Steer clear of using non-organic or overly sharp edge styles, as they would detract from the sophisticated, approachable feel"
  ],
